 Consequently,
 the entanglement entropy of the generated state increases monotonically over the course of the session,
 from 0 to 1 ebit.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This experiment is intended to convey the notion of entanglement as a 
\emph on
dynamically evolving quantity
\emph default
,
 associated with the progression of the game,
 rather than as a static or randomly determined property.
\end_layout

